1
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,040
Your Majesty, please wait a moment.

2
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:17,799
Prince Yu may be delayed by something.

3
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,400
Didn't he write to say

4
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:21,719
he would visit the Imperial Consort Dowager

5
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,400
at Lingguo Temple before coming to the palace?

6
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,799
He's too arrogant.

7
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,239
After returning to the capital,

8
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,519
he didn't even come to see me first.

9
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:34,480
[Here comes His Highness Prince Yu.]

10
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,280
Your Majesty,

11
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:40,959
Prince Yu has arrived.

12
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:44,120
I, Mu Yunzheng,

13
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:45,359
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

14
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:48,000
You have been away from the capital for years.

15
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,840
You must have forgotten the palace rules.

16
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,200
Entering the palace with weapons

17
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,599
is a serious breach of protocol.

18
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,000
This sword

19
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:59,000
is a gift to Your Majesty.

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,319
It's made from the skull of an enemy leader.

21
00:02:03,599 --> 00:02:05,760
May our empire

22
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,159
be invincible.

23
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,560
Prince Yu,

24
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,599
you're so kind.

25
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:26,719
After visiting my mother this morning,

26
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,960
I hurried to the palace.

27
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:30,199
But unexpectedly,

28
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,879
I was stopped by a commoner halfway.

29
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:34,719
So I was late.

30
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,439
I hope Your Majesty will punish me.

31
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:39,439
Your reputation as the Cold-faced General

32
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:41,120
has spread all over Kyoto.

33
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:44,240
Who dares to stop your way?

34
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:46,800
That woman held a bloody letter,

35
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:48,919
claiming to seek justice for her father.

36
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:51,319
I thought she was a rascal,

37
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,599
so I drove her away.

38
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:54,280
But just now,

39
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,879
I learned that

40
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,080
that woman

41
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,840
is actually Princess Consort of Rui.

42
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,360
I also heard that

43
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,960
she has been beating the Petition Drum

44
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,120
for several days.

45
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,560
Your Majesty,

46
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,879
I don't know about it.

47
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,520
All right.

48
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:10,000
We'll talk about it later.

49
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,680
Prince Yu,

50
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:12,960
please sit down.

51
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,800
You have been away from the capital for eight years.

52
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:26,800
Do you know why you are suddenly summoned back?

53
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:29,800
Wasn't it said that my mother was seriously ill?

54
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,439
I went to see her this morning.

55
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,159
I found she just caught a cold.

56
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,960
It's not as serious as the letter said.

57
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,479
Her illness is just an excuse.

58
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,360
I have another reason to call you back.

59
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,120
We were defeated by the Western Shu.

60
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:46,560
Soon,

61
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:49,479
they sent a letter of accusation.

62
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:52,199
They want to form an alliance with us.

63
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,680
They also said that the princess

64
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,840
wants to marry you.

65
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,639
I do have some relationship

66
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,879
with the princess of Western Shu,

67
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:04,800
but I have no intention of marrying her.

68
00:04:05,479 --> 00:04:07,479
I just want to guard the border

69
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:09,879
for Your Majesty and the Great Wei.

70
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:13,199
I know you are loyal to the Great Wei

71
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,560
without any doubt.

72
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,800
Therefore,

73
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,920
when I knew

74
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,120
Xiao Wei committed treason,

75
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:23,000
although I know your relationship with him,

76
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,879
I never doubted you for a moment.

77
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:28,000
After all, you are my brother,

78
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:31,279
and would never do anything to harm the empire.

79
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,399
Your Majesty,

80
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,639
I also don't know

81
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:39,879
why General Xiao would take such a rebellious action.

82
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,800
Xiao Wei and Shen Yi are guilty of treason,

83
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:45,319
although the evidence is solid,

84
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:49,199
there are still many speculations about this case.

85
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,040
Looking at the imperial court,

86
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:53,160
there is no suitable candidate to take over this case.

87
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:55,120
Why don't you take it over?

88
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:57,680
With Hao'er's assistance, of course.

89
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,000
Please forgive me.

90
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,199
I've been leading troops at the border for years.

91
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,079
I've never been involved in court affairs,

92
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,600
nor do I know how to investigate cases.

93
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:07,439
Please withdraw the order.

94
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,639
About this,

95
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,160
don't rush to refuse.

96
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,160
I'll think about it.

97
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,079
Uncle.

98
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,399
Uncle, please wait.

99
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,720
You just returned to Kyoto to take over such an important case.

100
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,959
If you need anything,

101
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,079
just let me know.

102
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,279
Who are you?

103
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,319
I apologize for my lack of manners.

104
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,720
I am Prince Jing Zhao.

105
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:43,680
Zhao'er.

106
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,600
When I was in the capital,

107
00:05:45,879 --> 00:05:46,639
I had some impression of you.

108
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,480
You've grown up a lot.

109
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:50,879
But you don't have to worry.

110
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:53,199
I won't take over this case.

111
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:54,399
Goodbye.

112
00:05:58,639 --> 00:06:00,279
Your Highness, you'll have to make do for a few days.

113
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,360
The mansion's been unused for years.

114
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:04,680
Renovating the yard alone took several days.

115
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,079
Your Highness,

116
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,800
there are still several places that need renovation.

117
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:08,759
It doesn't matter.

118
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,480
I live alone anyway.

119
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:13,240
Don't bother too much.

120
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:17,959
By the way,

121
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,639
prepare another guest room.

122
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,120
Prince, do you have a guest?

123
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,439
Is it for Shen Suhe?

124
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:29,879
You are

125
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,240
getting more and more unruly.

126
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:37,360
By the way,

127
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,560
I still have a question.

128
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:43,560
Since His Majesty has agreed to re-examine the case,

129
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,079
why do you still refuse?

130
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,040
After all,

131
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,680
there are less than half a month

132
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,759
before Minister Shen's execution.

133
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:51,920
Now is not the time to take over the case.

134
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,680
If we are not careful,

135
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,959
we will not only fail to overturn the case,

136
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:56,560
but also get ourselves into trouble.

137
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,360
By the way,

138
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,279
what has Shen Suhe done

139
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:02,160
during my absence?

140
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,560
Did she come to see me?

141
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,240
You left without saying goodbye

142
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,639
and didn't leave any message.

143
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,519
She can't find you even if she wants to.

144
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:11,720
But

145
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,800
the secret guard guarding the Imperial Consort Dowager said

146
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,360
that Miss Shen found the Imperial Consort Dowager

147
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,439
by some means.

148
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,279
The Imperial Consort Dowager asked her to hide in the room

149
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,959
and let the guard protect her.

150
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,839
She went to see the Imperial Consort Dowager?

151
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,439
When I visited the Queen Mother this morning,

152
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:37,040
she didn't mention this at all.

153
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:39,240
Did they really know each other?

154
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,199
Anything else?

155
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:45,639
Yes.

156
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,680
Miss Shen and her maid

157
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,920
sneaked out of Lingguo Temple several times

158
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,480
and went to the Prime Minister's Residence.

159
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,519
They should be looking for evidence.

160
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,839
During this period, the Second Prince's pursuers

161
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,879
were intercepted by us.

162
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:01,240
Did they mention what they were looking for?

163
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:02,720
No.

164
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,839
Shen Suhe

165
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,319
Your Highness

166
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,839
A woman is waiting outside to see you.

167
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:11,439
I...

168
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:12,959
We just moved in today,

169
00:08:13,079 --> 00:08:14,120
and someone came to visit.

170
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,319
Do you know who she is?

171
00:08:16,639 --> 00:08:18,079
The woman didn't tell her identity,

172
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,040
but she's been kneeling outside,

173
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,439
She said if she couldn't see you,

174
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,639
she would keep kneeling.

175
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,600
Shen Suhe.

176
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,319
She came so soon.

177
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,439
Send her away.

178
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,600
Yes, Your Highness.

179
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:33,759
Your Highness.

180
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,399
With her personality,

181
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:36,720
she won't leave.

182
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,039
We can't

183
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:40,120
let her keep kneeling there.

184
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:41,440
Then take her away.

185
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,480
Your Highness, are you willing to see me?

186
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:51,159
Miss,

187
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,360
His Highness has ordered that

188
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,320
he won't see any guests today.

189
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,480
Please go at your leisure.

190
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,399
I, Shen Suhe,

191
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:58,399
implore Your Highness to uphold justice

192
00:08:58,919 --> 00:09:01,279
and clear the names of the Prime Minister and General Xiao.

193
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:04,919
I, Shen Suhe,

194
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,080
implore Your Highness to uphold justice

195
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:10,639
for the Prime Minister and General Xiao.

196
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,000
I, Shen Suhe,

197
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,080
seek justice from Your Highness

198
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:19,120
for the Prime Minister and General Xiao.

199
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,759
I, Shen Suhe,

200
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:23,480
seek justice from Your Highness

201
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,639
for the Prime Minister and General Xiao.

202
00:09:27,279 --> 00:09:27,720
Your Highness,

203
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:30,639
are you going to let her keep this up?

204
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,320
Your reputation in Kyoto is already bad.

205
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,840
If she keeps this up,

206
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:35,879
I'm afraid

207
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,480
no one will dare to

208
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:39,159
step into the Yu Prince's Mansion.

209
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,200
Your Highness, please do justice.

210
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,840
Isn't that better?

211
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,960
I can have a peace of mind.

212
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,919
I, Shen Suhe,

213
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,279
seek justice from Your Highness.

214
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,480
I, Shen Suhe,

215
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,480
seek justice from Your Highness.

216
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,799
Please clear the names of the PM and General Xiao.

217
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,919
Shen Suhe, what a troublemaker!

218
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,200
She shouldn't have

219
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,480
provoked the Emperor's uncle.

220
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:03,200
Your Highness.

221
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:03,720
Your Highness.

222
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,320
Fifteenth,

223
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:07,159
do you think my father has suspected me

224
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,720
for asking the Emperor's uncle to take over the case?

225
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:10,360
Your Highness,

226
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,120
in my opinion,

227
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:14,879
His Majesty didn't suspect you,

228
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,679
but to test Prince Yu.

229
00:10:18,879 --> 00:10:19,480
Think about it,

230
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,279
Prince Yu has been at the border for eight years.

231
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:23,840
Now that he has suddenly returned to the capital,

232
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:27,120
Your Majesty naturally wants to test his loyalty.

233
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,159
What you said makes some sense.

234
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:32,159
But even so,

235
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,919
my uncle is a very strange person.

236
00:10:34,879 --> 00:10:36,200
If he really takes over this case,

237
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,679
I'm afraid he'll eventually find out about me.

238
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:39,960
Your Highness,

239
00:10:40,639 --> 00:10:41,559
do you remember

240
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,200
the novel about the princess consort

241
00:10:43,279 --> 00:10:45,600
and Prince Yu that was popular in the city?

242
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,320
Regardless of the authenticity of the novel,

243
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,919
there's no smoke without fire.

244
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,399
If His Majesty knows

245
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:54,080
that Prince Yu and Shen Residence are involved,

246
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:56,000
do you think

247
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,840
he will hand over the case to him?

248
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:00,600
Fifteenth,

249
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:03,120
I'll leave this to you.

250
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,200
Yes.

251
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,639
Uncle,

252
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,639
I didn't mean to offend you.

253
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,399
But I have no other way.

254
00:11:16,399 --> 00:11:17,799
Your Highness,

255
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:20,240
I beg you to uphold justice

256
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,840
and clear the names

257
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,840
of the Prime Minister and General Xiao.

258
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:25,200
Your Highness, you are really prescient.

259
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,720
The Second Prince has been spreading

260
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:28,519
rumors about you and the Prime Minister's Residence.

261
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,200
Fortunately, you returned to the capital

262
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,360
and did not take over the case.

263
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,039
However,

264
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:35,080
Shen Suhe has been kneeling here for so long.

265
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:37,279
I'm afraid she can't hold on

266
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,840
before the Prime Minister.

267
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,759
I beg Your Highness to uphold justice

268
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:41,559
and clear the Prime Minister's...

269
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:42,120
Go back.

270
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,919
and General Xiao's innocence.

271
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:47,399
Please help us

272
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,360
clear the names

273
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,159
of the PM and General Xiao.

274
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:56,000
Your Highness,

275
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,799
it's a scorching day.

276
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:02,840
Have some tea

277
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:03,840
to avoid heatstroke.

278
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,720
Take this pot of tea away.

279
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,639
To whom?

280
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:18,960
Well.

281
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,279
I'm Shen Suhe.

282
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:27,320
I want to see Prince Yu.

283
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,879
He's worried you might die here,

284
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,519
so he asked me to bring you tea.

285
00:12:38,639 --> 00:12:39,679
It's you.

286
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,159
Can I see him now?

287
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:45,000
You'd better leave.

288
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:48,039
He won't see you for a while.

289
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:53,279
What do you mean?

290
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:55,440
Does he

291
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,679
not want to see me now?

292
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,759
It's no use dragging me.

293
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:02,120
It's the prince who doesn't want to see you.

294
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,720
Do you know

295
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,559
where Master Lou went?

296
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:07,120
Master Lou?

297
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,080
You mean him?

298
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,039
He

299
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:13,720
was sent by the prince to deal with other affairs.

300
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,240
When will he come back?

301
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:18,879
It may take a few months

302
00:13:18,879 --> 00:13:20,000
or years.

303
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,679
I don't know the details.

304
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,480
Where was he sent to?

305
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:26,600
How can I get in touch with him?

306
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,200
If he wants to see you,

307
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,360
he will come to you.

308
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,159
If not,

309
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,320
you can't get in touch with him.

310
00:13:36,799 --> 00:13:37,519
I advise you

311
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,559
to forget him as soon as possible.

312
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,679
Forget?

313
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,639
How can I forget him so easily?

314
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,639
I, Shen Suhe,

315
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:01,320
implore you to seek justice

316
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:05,080
and clear the names of the PM and General Xiao.

317
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:08,960
Rui'er,

318
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,799
how long has His Highness not been here?

319
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,200
Maybe three or five days.

320
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:17,279
It seems that since Prince Yu returned,

321
00:14:17,519 --> 00:14:19,200
His Highness has never been here.

322
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:21,320
By the way,

323
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:22,879
I also heard that

324
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,600
Shen Suhe knelt at the gate of Prince Yu's Mansion every day.

325
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:27,559
Shen Suhe again?

326
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,600
What does she want to do with my uncle?

327
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:31,240
For what else?

328
00:14:31,639 --> 00:14:33,919
She just wants Prince Yu to help her save her father.

329
00:14:34,639 --> 00:14:37,080
It's a pity that she can't even get in the mansion.

330
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:38,559
Let alone to see Prince Yu.

331
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,600
No wonder His Highness stays in the study all day.

332
00:14:42,639 --> 00:14:45,639
He's afraid that my uncle will interfere in the case.

333
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,480
I can't let that bitch continue to make trouble.

334
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:27,840
Your Highness,

335
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,559
it's raining cats and dogs.

336
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:31,559
She's still kneeling outside.

337
00:16:00,279 --> 00:16:01,960
Isn't this Miss Shen of the Prime Minister's Residence?

338
00:16:02,919 --> 00:16:05,039
How did Miss Shen get like this?

339
00:16:08,039 --> 00:16:08,840
At this time,

340
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,600
who are you still putting on airs for?

341
00:16:11,639 --> 00:16:13,399
From Lingguo Temple to Prince Yu's Mansion,

342
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:14,720
haven't you been humiliated enough?

343
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:15,960
What are you pretending?

344
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,639
What?

345
00:16:20,399 --> 00:16:21,559
Your Highness has found a new lover?

346
00:16:22,559 --> 00:16:24,200
You have time to come here to bother me.

347
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,679
Shut up.

348
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,440
Your act

349
00:16:29,159 --> 00:16:30,240
is really clumsy.

350
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:31,919
Shen Suhe,

351
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,360
don't be so complacent.

352
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,440
Even if you kneel here to death,

353
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,120
the Emperor Uncle will not care about you.

354
00:16:38,759 --> 00:16:39,960
Your father

355
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,639
is beyond help.

356
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:43,639
Ling Chuchu,

357
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:45,200
if I were you,

358
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,799
I would have thought about my own way out.

359
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:50,080
You still have the leisure

360
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,080
to come here and insult me.

361
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,000
What do you mean?

362
00:16:55,519 --> 00:16:57,279
Now my father has been imprisoned,

363
00:16:58,279 --> 00:16:59,759
and I have been expelled from the mansion.

364
00:17:00,879 --> 00:17:02,159
But Prince Rui

365
00:17:02,759 --> 00:17:04,519
has never asked His Majesty

366
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,960
to divorce me.

367
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:08,000
Do you really think

368
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:09,759
he only loves you?

369
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:11,160
What are you talking about?

370
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:12,920
He promised me

371
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,880
that after your father is beheaded,

372
00:17:15,079 --> 00:17:16,400
he will make me the principal wife.

373
00:17:19,039 --> 00:17:19,839
Principal wife?

374
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,480
You are too naive.

375
00:17:23,759 --> 00:17:25,319
If I can save my father,

376
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:27,519
I will be the only principal consort

377
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,119
of Prince Rui's Mansion.

378
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,519
If I don't save my father,

379
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,039
the Second Prince will have no opponent

380
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,759
in the imperial court.

381
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:37,680
He

382
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,640
will be the only candidate for the Crown Prince.

383
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,720
At that time, many noble families

384
00:17:43,359 --> 00:17:44,920
will want to marry their daughters to him.

385
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:47,200
Do you really think you can keep

386
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,079
his heart for a lifetime?

387
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,400
Shut up!

388
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,880
Shen Suhe,

389
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,599
stop pretending!

390
00:18:15,039 --> 00:18:15,480
Get up!

391
00:18:16,599 --> 00:18:17,240
Get up!

392
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:18,599
Still pretending?

393
00:18:25,119 --> 00:18:25,880
I... I...

394
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,119
I can't breathe.

395
00:18:29,079 --> 00:18:30,839
Who dares to be so rude in front of my mansion?

396
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:34,720
Your Highness,

397
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:36,480
I'm the secondary consort of the Second Prince.

398
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:38,880
I... I didn't mean it.

399
00:18:39,799 --> 00:18:40,599
You rascal!

400
00:18:41,039 --> 00:18:42,039
You not only hurt people without reason,

401
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,319
but also cling to the royal family.

402
00:18:43,799 --> 00:18:44,119
Guards!

403
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:45,880
Take her to the court to be punished.

404
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,480
I'm the beloved concubine of the Second Prince.

405
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,240
How dare you!

406
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:50,599
You...

407
00:18:50,599 --> 00:18:51,599
You let me go!

408
00:19:05,039 --> 00:19:06,039
Don't you want to see me?

409
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:06,720
Stop pretending.

410
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:10,200
Your Highness,

411
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:13,799
I had to do this.

412
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,039
Your Highness.

413
00:19:19,279 --> 00:19:20,759
Shen Suhe, Shen Suhe.

414
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,119
Your Highness,

415
00:19:32,599 --> 00:19:34,599
I just wanted to help you deal with Shen Suhe

416
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:35,960
and drive her away from your mansion.

417
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,400
So you sent her to my mansion.

418
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,119
I...

419
00:19:38,759 --> 00:19:40,240
I didn't expect that.

420
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,079
Shen Suhe is really cunning.

421
00:19:46,039 --> 00:19:46,720
But Your Highness,

422
00:19:47,119 --> 00:19:47,920
in this way,

423
00:19:48,079 --> 00:19:50,200
the rumors all over the city will be confirmed.

424
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:54,000
The uncle and the princess consort...

425
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:54,640
Shut up.

426
00:19:57,880 --> 00:20:00,119
You don't want those rumors to come true, do you?

427
00:20:00,559 --> 00:20:02,319
You're starting to care about Shen Suhe, aren't you?

428
00:20:02,359 --> 00:20:03,000
What do you know?

429
00:20:03,559 --> 00:20:04,920
What I want is for my uncle not to interfere,

430
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,559
and Shen Yi not to rise again.

431
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,000
You sent Shen Suhe in.

432
00:20:09,119 --> 00:20:10,200
How stupid you are!

433
00:20:12,759 --> 00:20:14,559
Then why don't you report him?

434
00:20:15,079 --> 00:20:16,440
Report him for having an affair with Shen Suhe.

435
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,599
I'll see how he can continue the trial.

436
00:20:20,279 --> 00:20:21,559
That's right.

437
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,039
But what I want to report is

438
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,640
that he used public power for private gain,

439
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,799
colluded with the PM's Residence,

440
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,759
and was a traitor with Shen Yi.

441
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,240
My father has always been wary of him.

442
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:32,640
Maybe

443
00:20:33,319 --> 00:20:35,319
what I did just meets his wishes.
